ganizzate all'USI:</p> <table> <tbody> <tr> <th> <p>Data</p> </th> <th> <p>Evento</p> </th> <th> <p>Campus</p> </th> <th> <p>Informazioni</p> </th> </tr> <tr> <td>12 Giugno 2026</td> <td><a href=\"/it/originalnode/43971\">Master in Digital Fashion Communication Alumni Reunion </a></td> <td>Lugano</td> <td><a href=\"/it/originalnode/43971\">Event Details</a></td> </tr> <tr> <td>24 Aprile 2026</td> <td><a href=\"/it/feeds/33482\">30 anni USI Alumni Reunion</a></td> <td>Lugano</td> <td><a href=\"/it/feeds/33482\">Event Details</a></td> </tr> <tr> <td>24 Ottobre 2025</td> <td><a href=\"/en/originalnode/42135\">10 Years USI Alumni Master in Economics Reunion</a></td> <td>Lugano</td> <td><a href=\"/it/feeds/32500\">Event Details</a></td> </tr> <tr> <td>19 Settembre 2025</td> <td><a href=\"/it/originalnode/40682\">20 years - USI Alumni Master in International Tourism Reunion</a></td> <td>Lugano</td> <td><a href=\"/it/feeds/31049\">Event Details</a></td> </tr> <tr> <td>9 Maggio 2025</td> <td><a href=\"/it/originalnode/39775\">20 years - USI Alumni Informatics Reunion</a></td> <td>Lugano</td> <td><a href=\"/en/feeds/30639\">Event Details</a></td> </tr> <tr> <td>26 Aprile 2024</td> <td>USI MT Alumni Reunion - Class of 2019</td> <td>Lugano</td> <td><a href=\"/it/feeds/28083\">Event Details</a></td> </tr> <tr> <td>19 Dicembre 2023</td> <td>USI Alumni 21-22-23 Master in Finance Get Together</td> <td>Lugano e Online</td> <td><a href=\"/it/feeds/26627\">Event Details</a></td> </tr> <tr> <td>2 Marzo 2023</td> <td>USI Alumni in Finance Class 2020 Get Together</td> <td>Lugano e Online</td> <td><a href=\"/en/node/24194\">Event Details</a></td> </tr> <tr> <td>3-5 Settembre 2021</td> <td><a href=\"https://www.usi25.usi.ch/it/momenti/alumni-alumnae-reunion\">USI25 Alumni Reunion</a></td> <td>Mendrisio e Lugano</td> <td><a href=\"https://www.usi25.usi.ch/it/momenti/alumni-alumnae-reunion\">Event Details</a></td> </tr> <tr> <td>8 Luglio 2017</td> <td>10 anni Alumni Architettura Classe 2007</td> <td>Mendrisio</td> <td><a href=\"/it/feeds/5670\">Event Details</a></td> </tr> <tr> <td>24 Maggio 2017</td> <td>Alumni Architettura - Il viaggio come ricerca</td> <td>Mendrisio</td> <td><a href=\"/it/feeds/5033\">Event Details</a></td> </tr> <tr> <td>26 Novembre 2016</td> <td><a href=\"/it/feeds/5384\">10 Years USI Master Reunion</a></td> <td>Lugano</td> <td><a href=\"http://www.foto.usi.ch/plogger/index.php?level=album&amp;id=110\">Galleria fotografica</a></td> </tr> <tr> <td>16 Aprile 2010</td> <td>USIRefresh: 10 anni di lauree</td> <td>Lugano</td> <td><a href=\"/it/feeds/5420\">Event Details</a></td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <p>Vuoi partecipare a un evento? Hai un’idea che vuoi condividere?<br> Contattaci: <a href=\"mailto:alumni@usi.ch\">alumni@usi.ch</a></p>"}],"ctas":[],"nav":[{"label":"Area alumni","href":"/it/universita/info/alumni"},{"label":"Il mio profilo Alumni","href":"/it/universita/info/alumni/my-alumni/profilo"},{"label":"La mia Career Story","href":"/it/universita/info/alumni/my-alumni/la-mia-career-story"},{"label":"Benefici","href":"/it/universita/info/alumni/my-alumni/benefici"},{"label":"Il mio Chapter","href":"/it/originalnode/8951"},{"label":"Calendario Alumni","href":"/it/universita/info/alumni/eventi/calendario-alumni"},{"label":"Alumni Talks","href":"/it/universita/info/alumni/meet-the-alumni/digital-talks"},{"label":"Visiting Alumni","href":"/it/universita/info/alumni/meet-the-alumni/visiting-alumni"},{"label":"Chapter Meetings","href":"/it/universita/info/alumni/meet-the-alumni/chapter-meetings"},{"label":"Reunions","href":"/it/universita/info/alumni/meet-the-alumni/reunions"},{"label":"Dati e cifre","href":"/it/universita/info/alumni/ritratti/i-laureati-usi"},{"label":"USI Career Stories","href":"/it/universita/info/alumni/ritratti/career-stories"},{"label":"USI Alumni Mentors","href":"/it/universita/info/alumni/ritratti/usi-alumni-mentors"},{"label":"Indagine Placement","href":"/it/universita/info/alumni/ritratti/indagine-laureati"